# The Criteo file (297 MB gz) and the DuckDB database are never committed.
# R/01_download.R reproduces them; data/raw/MANIFEST.csv records size, MD5 and
# retrieval date. The dataset is CC-BY-NC-SA 4.0 and is fetched, not mirrored.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/MANIFEST.csv
data/derived/*

# Fitted objects are regenerated by the pipeline. Tables and figures ARE
# committed: the README renders them.
output/*.rds

.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj
.DS_Store
